# tinyproxy domain filter — only LernSax may be reached through this relay.
# Referenced by `Filter` in tinyproxy.conf with FilterDefaultDeny Yes.
#
# LernSax is not just `www`: file and mail-attachment download URLs handed out
# by the JSON-RPC API point at `d.lernsax.de`. Matching the apex plus any
# subdomain covers both, and any further host WebWeaver decides to hand out.
# The leading `\.` matters — `lernsax\.de$` alone would also match
# `notlernsax.de`.
#
# Basic POSIX regexes (tinyproxy's default — FilterExtended is off), so no
# groups or alternation here.
^lernsax\.de$
\.lernsax\.de$
